{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/970015-solar-judgment-flare-questions","id":970015,"title":"Solar Judgment Flare Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-15T10:19:51-07:00","id":970015,"title":"Solar Judgment Flare Questions","content":"This Essence 5 Archery Charm from Miracles of the Solar Exalted seems like everything I ever wanted in a super powered Solar Archer's hands, except for the fact I am struggling to figure out how it works.<br /> <br /> \u200bIt notes that it is an attack on opponents a minimum of 3 range bands away and tells you how to roll damage, but it doesn't express how you hit with it? Is it like it's prereq Nova Arrow, which would make sense, or is it a normal Archery attack against the defenses of everyone within the area and if they parry or dodge it are not subject to the damage? Or perhaps it is an attack against a single target, who takes the brunt of the damage, and then all others standing in the zone take the latter described ambient effects?<br /> <br /> \u200bThe Charm goes on to say that everyone in the burning nova takes damage, which it describes earlier, but then continues on to say that all characters are subject to a high intensity bonfire. Why questions here are does everyone take this damage in addition to the damage described earlier in the Charm? Do only people standing where the arrow comes down take the initial damage and then everyone outside that zone take the bonfire?<br /> <br /> \u200bI want to love this Charm, but for some reason I cannot wrap my brain around how it works. Can anyone help shed some light on this for me?<br /> <br /> \u200bThanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/777-bronze-tiger","name":"Bronze Tiger","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T10:29:12-07:00","id":970019,"title":"","content":"I'll try to give my best explanation:<br /> <br /> You make a normal Decisive attack against a target at least three range bands away. You must have at least 15 initiative to use it.<br /> If the attack hits, it gets (greater of Essence or three) auto-successes. Then, you can pay up to (half current initiative) in motes to get that many extra damage dice. This damage only affects the primary target of the attack. <br /> Then, it causes a long line away from the target, one range band for every five initiative (rounded up). Everyone in this line takes damage as if in a high intensity bonfire (6L/round).<br /> A character hit by this attack is flung backwards one range band for every three health levels lost from the attack.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}